<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EDS EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EDS EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said analyst Gary Helmig lowered his earnings estimates on Electronic Data Systems Corp for fiscal years 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1997 estimate to $2.25 per share from $2.32.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1998 estimate to $2.63 per share from $2.68.</p>
<p>-- Kept ratings at short-term hold and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 9-5/8 to 32-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
